<Sequential id="mastery_placeholder" title="Mastery Learning">
  <Markdown>
## Coming Soon: Mastery Learning

How do you ensure every student actually *learns* the material, not just passes through it? Benjamin Bloom showed that mastery-based approaches can close the gap between average and exceptional students (the "2-sigma problem" from Chapter 1).

This chapter will cover:
* Bloom's mastery learning framework
* Designing for mastery vs. designing for completion
* Support for mastery learning in this platform
  </Markdown>
